@vsm 1.2.1

// Debt Register: Instance Isolation and Clone Portability
// Generated: audit trail + clone_preflight analysis
// Owner: rmw3 (S5)

@debts

  D10 - MCP servers hardcoded /home/rmw3 paths
    severity: critical
    files: opencode.json, .opencode/mcp/parse_query_mcp.py,
           .opencode/mcp/socratic_mcp_with_bridge.py
    impact: clone will fail to start MCP servers
    fix: use PATH_FROM_ROOT pattern (env var + __file__ fallback)
    effort: small

  D11 - 6+ files use ssh root@n02 without env var fallback
    severity: high
    files: tasks_reconcile.py, ac_algedonic.py, sd_digest.py,
           state-reconcile.ts, covenant_preflight.sh
    impact: clone targeting different host will break SSH ops
    fix: add VSF_N02 env var (s5_inbox.py already does this)
    effort: small

  D12 - vsf_predicates.py/health_predicates.py hardcoded NATS IP
    severity: high
    files: scripts/vsl/classifier/vsf_predicates.py,
           scripts/vsl/classifier/health_predicates.py
    impact: clone in different network will fail NATS connection
    fix: add NATS_HOST env var fallback
    effort: small

  D13 - .git/info/exclude not configured for scratch state
    severity: moderate
    impact: clone shows untracked scratch files
    fix: populate .git/info/exclude with EXCLUDE_WANT list
    effort: small

  D14 - skip-worktree not set on tracked scratch files
    severity: moderate
    impact: scratch state may leak into git sync on clone
    fix: git update-index --skip-worktree on SKIPWORKTREE_WANT files
    effort: small

  D15 - .trust_state.json uses absolute paths as keys
    severity: low
    impact: stale state after clone (not blocking)
    fix: regenerate on first run if paths dont match VOSLAB_PATH
    effort: small

  D16 - LXC container IDs hardcoded (101-117)
    severity: low
    files: service_watchdog.py, cyberfilter_variety.py, etc.
    impact: only matters if deploying to different Proxmox host
    fix: topology config file or env vars
    effort: medium

  D17 - VOSLAB_PATH frozen at import time in rsi_cycle.py
    severity: moderate
    impact: env var set after import has no effect
    fix: lazy resolution (compute on first use)
    effort: small

  D18 - GPG signing timeout (commits unsigned)
    severity: cosmetic
    impact: commits not cryptographically signed
    fix: configure gpg-agent timeout or use SSH signing
    effort: small

  D19 - detected_faults.json stale in production
    severity: moderate
    impact: fault detector loads stale state
    fix: cleanup script or auto-expiry
    effort: small

@isolationRequirements

  R1. All paths resolve from VOSLAB_PATH or __file__
  R2. SSH targets use env vars (VSF_N02, VSF_N01)
  R3. NATS connection uses env var (NATS_HOST)
  R4. State dirs under VOSLAB_PATH/state/
  R5. Session IDs unique per process
  R6. Scratch state excluded via git info/exclude + skip-worktree
  R7. clone_preflight.py must PASS before clone is promoted


